PS5 GPU on 7.3.1 + rmux shitshow: thermal governor, overlay metrics

- GPU clock governor with a temperature limit (Borchev, #66; ps5_gpufreq.temp_limit, 85 C by default). rmux's
  devfreq ps5-gpufreq has no thermal limit and stays disabled (CONFIG_PS5_GPUFREQ)
- gpu_busy_percent and the SoC temperature for the Steam overlay and MangoHud
- Pro (Viola firmware): amdgpu's own gpu_busy_percent is used, gpu_metrics reported as unsupported
---
